      ":question/problem": "Find $k$ given that the vectors $a=\u27e80,k,3\u27e9$, $b=\u27e80,-2,3\u27e9$, and $c=\u27e8-1,2,0\u27e9$ are coplanar.\n\n$k=${{field-1}}",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "5cb1bf8f-1b29-5aa6-90b9-7802a2f90bd0",
