      ":question/problem": "Find $k$ given that the vectors $a=\u27e82,-1,-1\u27e9$, $b=\u27e8-2,k,-3\u27e9$, and $c=\u27e80,0,1\u27e9$ are coplanar.\n\n$k=${{field-1}}",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "4af35ae9-0cab-5b29-a56e-dee11d762668",
          ":answer-field/key": "field-1",
