      ":question/problem": "Find $k$ given that the vectors $a=\u27e8-1,-1,-1\u27e9$, $b=\u27e80,0,1\u27e9$, and $c=\u27e82,k,0\u27e9$ are coplanar.\n\n$k=${{field-1}}",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "f9f34462-3be9-5bb7-b470-a542b0ba2547",
