      ":question/problem": "Find $k$ given that the vectors $a=\u27e81,k,-3\u27e9$, $b=\u27e8-2,-1,0\u27e9$, and $c=\u27e80,2,-2\u27e9$ are coplanar.\n\n$k=${{field-1}}",
